abstract: >
  A Python and SQL data analytics project exploring factors related to store sales performance. The project uses relational retail data containing regions, stores, employees, and sales. SQL and SQLite are used to connect and summarize the related tables, while pandas and Python are used to analyze relationships between total sales, store size, employee count, and sales per employee.

